              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Catlin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was kind of leery at first on how the flavors would go with each other. The blueberry, banana and peanut butter played very nicely against each other, you could taste each individually instead of one overpowering the other. I used the wheat germ in it. Overall, it was really tasty and will definitely make again!"
