              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Aussie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It turned out to be a very satisfying breakfast on its own. I think all the flavors balanced themselves out well. I did use PB2 peanut butter powder because that was the peanut butter I had on hand and I threw in a couple pitches of spinach greens. I will most likely make this again sometime in the future!",
