            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "foodlover"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious, filling, and a big hit with the kids. I use blueberry yogurt and omit the the honey. Another great tip is to use frozen bananas. I take my ripe bananas (peeled and broken into chunks)and throw them in a ziplock in the freezer. This makes my morning even easier!",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-08T03:25:04.170Z"
          },
