            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jodie Lilley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used a mix of blackcurrents, redcurrants and blueberries, and I used almond milk in place of the yoghurt and milk (an easy vegan swap!). It was DELICIOUS!! Wasn't sure how it would all combine but it was one of the tastiest smoothies I've ever made, will definitely make again :)",
            "datePublished": "2016-01-24T04:38:09.460Z"
